 "message": "A green slime blob splits in two over 8 frames: it wobbles, pulls apart, and flings small goo droplets left, right and up, then the two halves settle. The droplets are small at 1x, so the goo-count and goo-speed sliders are the ones to raise if you want more spray. I used a 4-tone green ramp with a dark outline in a 16-bit style; the background is left clear for your game.",
